  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multistakeholder workshop and policy dialogue on circular textile in Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project supports the development of a structured Bangladesh&#x2013;Netherlands government-to-government collaboration in the circular textile sector. It focuses on identifying key challenges, solutions, and partnership opportunities within Bangladesh&#x2019;s textile value chain.Through a multistakeholder workshop, policy dialogue, and the design of a policy hackathon in Dhaka, the initiative brings together representatives from government, the private sector, and knowledge institutions. The activities contribute to defining priority areas for bilateral cooperation and advancing a coordinated approach to circular textile development in Bangladesh.</narrative>
  </description>
